WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:10.630
With Premium, every set gets a target to beat, worked out from last time and how hard it felt.

2
00:00:10.984 --> 00:00:11.944
Here's how.

3
00:00:12.306 --> 00:00:16.386
On Home, tap a routine to start it, like Push day.

4
00:00:16.745 --> 00:00:21.865
Under each set is its target. Here, it's one more rep than last time.

5
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.780
Tap the Why button to see the math.

6
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:27.610
Tap the target to fill in the set.

7
00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:30.773
After the set, type in how hard it felt,

8
00:00:31.128 --> 00:00:33.128
and tap the check to log it.

9
00:00:33.737 --> 00:00:38.057
Set 2 has its own target. Fill it in, and keep going.
